from q import *
Q('A2-L001','Past Simple (regular): introduction',
 'eu consigo contar o que aconteceu numa viagem usando o Past Simple regular.',
 ('Reading · A travel flyer',ad('Remember Your Trip to Lisbon?',['Last June, our guests **visited** the old town, **walked** along the river and **tasted** fresh fish. They **loved** the city and **decided** to return.','Our hotel **offered** free breakfast and **arranged** a tour on the first day. **Could you help me?** said one guest, and the staff **answered** at once.','Book your next trip now!'],gloss=[('guest','hóspede'),('arrange','organizar'),('tour','passeio guiado'),('return','voltar')])),
 [('The guests visited Lisbon in June.','T','“Last June…”'),('The hotel charged for breakfast.','F','“free breakfast.”'),('The guests did not like the city.','F','“loved the city.”')],
 [('“arrange” means…',['organizar','cancelar','pagar'],0,'arrange = organizar.'),('“tour” means…',['passeio guiado','mapa','ônibus'],0,'tour.')],
 G('Past Simple: regular verbs',['Regra','Presente → Passado'],[['maioria: **+ed**','visit → **visited**, walk → **walked**'],['termina em -e: **+d**','love → **loved**, decide → **decided**'],['consoante + y: **-ied**','study → **studied**, carry → **carried**'],['1 vogal + 1 consoante: dobra','stop → **stopped**, plan → **planned**']],'O Past Simple é igual para **todos os sujeitos**: *I visited, she visited, they visited*.','Não use *did* na afirmativa: *I visited* (não *I did visit*).'),
 [('We ___ the old town. (visit)','visited','passado regular.','We visited the old town'),('They ___ to return. (decide)','decided','+d.',None),('She ___ the fish. (taste)','tasted','+ed.',None),('The staff ___ at once. (answer)','answered','+ed.',None)],
 ['traveler;viajante;The traveler arrived late.;O viajante chegou tarde.','tour;passeio guiado;We took a tour.;Fizemos um passeio.','arrange;organizar;She arranged the trip.;Ela organizou a viagem.','come back;voltar;They came back in July.;Eles voltaram em julho.','old town;cidade antiga;We walked in the old town.;Andamos na cidade antiga.','riverside;beira do rio;A riverside café.;Um café à beira do rio.','souvenir;lembrança;I bought a souvenir.;Comprei uma lembrança.','departure;partida;The departure was at nine.;A partida foi às nove.','arrival;chegada;Our arrival was late.;Nossa chegada foi tarde.','luggage;bagagem;The luggage was heavy.;A bagagem estava pesada.'],
 ('At the hotel',[('Guest','Could you help me? I need a taxi.','Pode me ajudar? Preciso de um táxi.'),('Clerk','Of course. We arranged one yesterday.','Claro. Organizamos um ontem.'),('Guest','Thank you. We visited the old town today.','Obrigado. Visitamos a cidade antiga hoje.'),('Clerk','Wonderful! Did you love it?','Maravilhoso! Gostou?')]),
 [('Tell what you visited last year.','Conte.','I visited my aunt last year.'),('Ask for help politely.','Peça.','Could you help me, please?'),('Say what you decided.','Diga.','I decided to study English.')],
 ('Write 5 sentences about a past trip (regular verbs).','Last summer I visited Lisbon. I walked along the river. We tasted fresh fish. I loved the old town. We decided to return.',['Usei **5 verbos no passado**','Usei **-ed / -d**','Usei **um tempo passado** (last…)'],'5 frases'),
 verbs=[('choose','escolher','I choose a hotel.','She chooses a seat.')],pv=[('check in','fazer check-in','We checked in at noon.','Fizemos check-in ao meio-dia.')],expr=[('Could you help me?','Pode me ajudar?')])
