 ('Reading · A recipe',text('Camp Stew (as we cooked it)',['Last night we **cooked** a simple stew at camp. First, we **chopped** an onion and **added** two potatoes. Then we **boiled** water and **poured** it over the pot.','We **stirred** the stew for ten minutes and **tasted** it. It **needed** salt, so we **sprinkled** a little. Everyone **enjoyed** the meal.'],kicker='RECIPE · CAMPING',by='Trail notebook',gloss=[('stew','ensopado'),('stir','mexer'),('sprinkle','polvilhar'),('boil','ferver')])),
